{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3f191e5983ca108edd875c215d367f62e6d9caef63a98e4987e5463ecb2e6db0","ja":"ふたりの異変","zh":"两人的异常","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7af0abc302cf6412473d702b614d1b7e798e5107ef154a1b7a9c86710cb8198b","ja":"想定してたよりいっぱい、お客さんが来てくれて\nるんだって！　会社の人たち、喜んでたぞ！","zh":"听说来的客人比预想的多得多呢！\n公司的人都很高兴哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2544be3031986aaa3a06b942f8904cb908ef49ee8119d9ca4c180450e9f4cc55","ja":"うっうー！　よかったですー！\nしっかり休憩して、この後もたくさん頑張りましょー♪","zh":"呜～呜——！太好了——！\n好好休息一下，之后也要加倍努力哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"644608b3ebb5b83cdd03fcb1d09f07a567ba5e615b64ed2bb14f3489166d78f5","ja":"うん。そ、そう……だね……。","zh":"嗯。也、也是……呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b7e59f12b80673b71797a032efffb5e8c51fd55e629fe24333ed33ec128026fe","ja":"どうしたの、育？\nなんかちょっと、声がかすれてるみたいだぞ？","zh":"怎么了，育？\n声音听起来好像有点沙哑哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"4898101c987430dfe14991dbbfa87356233a480e93032430133743cebb2dab3e","ja":"うん……ちょっと……\n張り切りすぎちゃった……かも。んっ、んん……っ。","zh":"嗯……稍微……\n有点太拼了……也说不定。唔，唔嗯……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"a91e2eb2bb47b6ea2858c5daa2187eb89925c057099aa4f31c3b133f5bcaabd2","ja":"育も？　たまきも、なんだか……\nさっきから、のどがイガイガしちゃってるぞ……。","zh":"育也是吗？环总觉得……\n刚才开始，喉咙就有点发痒了呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"a9bc13f7ffaffc5317e3dfb72f94055095e80df95517760d56e3063dfe829993","ja":"育と環は、昨日もイベントのお仕事だったもんね。\n無理しないでいいよ。","zh":"育和环昨天也参加了活动工作呢。\n不用太勉强哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"3ba6c8398909e9e2d64db277905e2d1d8cb8283c0e3f7ee3868d26fd425747ce","ja":"ええっ……！？　や、やだ……！\nたまき、もっともっとみんなに……んんっ！","zh":"诶……！？不、不要……！\n环还想更多、更多地为大家……唔！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"577525ce2b5912c2da9cd362bfb9dc8a00a9b66f7eb19fb680fe2d0f369431d5","ja":"いい？　宣伝は、声の大きさだけが重要じゃないの。\nふたりは、ちがう頑張り方をすればいいのよ。","zh":"听好了？宣传可不光是声音大才重要。\n你们两个，用不同的方式去努力就好啦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b33a968391c4fc73cc0e2236ead667a6764d855b03da47bacf59c95d3296dfcc","ja":"丁寧な動作と笑顔を意識して、周りをよく見て行動する\n……そうすれば、イベントを盛り上げられるわよ。","zh":"注意动作要优雅得体，保持微笑，并且多观察周围再行动\n……只要做到这些，就能把活动的气氛带动起来哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"bcc6bff8170060a39489c6172444cb8e20e8442037c70ed83a9f4ee665703fd9","ja":"えがおで、みんなのことを見て、\nこうどうする……うん、それならたまき、できるぞ。","zh":"带着笑容看着大家，\n然后再行动……嗯，那样的话环能做到哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"1d9656a1dae1b89df2008ff186c6cc26aef923edcb14e9fa19593c2227f35ce9","ja":"イベントのことなら桃子がちゃんとわかってるし、\nふたりの分まで説明してあげるよ。","zh":"活动的事桃子都很清楚，\n连同你们两个人的份，由我来解释给你们听吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"0c5e4e479bfacd32ba6e798b6968a2be9ef220577dafb1f93090e8235b2091b2","ja":"それに、環と育の分まで自分たちが\nいーっぱい声を出せば、問題ないからね！","zh":"而且，只要我们连环和育的份一起\n大声喊出来，就完全没问题啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"9775afb8641e5a10ea54323f4f808295822a89680d2c474862efc6c3b4b8ebd0","ja":"うっうー！\n大きい声なら、任せてくださ～いっ！","zh":"呜～呜～！\n比大嗓门的话，就包在我身上吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1757.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"5d547ebddbb6cc3f45c585e38af5d66ef9048746a407ad19c210771ebdf9f8b8","ja":"みんな……あ、ありがとう。わたしも、\nわたしにできることをがんばるね……んんっ。","zh":"大家……谢、谢谢你们。我也会\n努力做好自己能做的事的……嗯！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
